  "_note": "Lead rhythm cells per bar (docs/melody-and-solo-brief.md §5.2): 8 eighth-note cells, n = a note starts, - = it's held, . = rest. Every bar starts with a note on beat 1. Endings put the last note on a strong beat (cell 0, 2, 4 or 6), held. Seed 0 takes the first option; regenerate picks others. Intro bars: 4 bars = call1, call2, call1 (the motif answers itself), end; 8 bars = call1, call2 three times, then call1, end.",
